<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_12> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Cracking and Reseal Pressures at 70°F (20°C): definitions of cracking, reseal and back pressure and the caution about higher initial cracking pressure after a period without actuation."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Cracking and Reseal Pressures at 70°F (20℃)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers how cracking, reseal and back pressure are defined for the page 4 tables."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 4 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_56> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Special cleaning and packaging SC-11 (MS-06-63, ASTM G93 Level C): standard for C, CA and CH valves with VCR or VCO ends, orderable for other end connections with -SC11 (example SS-2C-1/3-SC11)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Special Cleaning and Packaging (SC-11)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers how to order SC-11 cleaning for valves that do not have it as standard."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 14 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_64> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Warranty information (Swagelok Limited Lifetime Warranty), trademarks (VCR, VCO, Swagelok) and the catalog identification MS-01-176, RevN, December 2025."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Warranty Information" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which warranty applies and which catalog revision this is."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 16 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_7> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Technical Data definitions: cracking pressure (inlet pressure at the first indication of flow), reseal pressure (no indication of flow) and back pressure (differential between inlet and outlet), plus the caution that initial cracking pressure may be higher after a period without actuation."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Technical Data" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers how cracking, reseal and back pressure are defined in this catalog."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 3 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:table_azure_24> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Metal gasket kits for the CA and C series in two parts: basic kit ordering numbers per valve series (2C/4C, 6C/8C, 12C/16C, CA, with the number of gaskets) and the gasket material designators (316 SS SS, alloy 400 M, aluminum A), with availability footnotes."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "CA and C Series Metal Gasket Kits - table 1" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the basic metal gasket kit ordering number and the gasket material designator."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 15 .

