<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_52> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Deflector cap option for 4C, 8C, CP and CPA valves with male NPT ends: polyethylene cap that deflects flow away from personnel and keeps contaminants out, rated 300 psig at 100°F (20.6 bar at 37°C); -DG green or -DR red (example SS-4CPA2-DR-3)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Deflector Caps (4C, 8C, CP, and CPA Series)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers what the deflector cap does, its rating and how to order it."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 14 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_54> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Technical data of the sour gas CH valves: 5000 psig (344 bar) at 70°F (20°C), -50 to 300°F (-45 to 148°C), nominal cracking pressures 1/3, 1 and 5 psi, 1/4, 3/8 and 1/2 in. tube fittings, alloy 400 body and poppet, ethylene propylene seals, PTFE backup ring, alloy X-750 spring."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Technical Data" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the ratings, cracking pressures, end connections and materials of the sour gas CH valves."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 14 .

<urn:plantdocs:swagelok-ms-01-176:source:section_55> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Ordering of sour gas CH valves (replace SS with M, insert -SG, example M-CHS4-SG-1/3) and the ECE R110-type approved CH valves with Buna C seals for alternative fuel service: -40 to 185°F (-40 to 85°C), 3770 psig (260 bar), ordered with -11670."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Ordering Information" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "swagelok-ms-01-176.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers how to order sour gas CH valves and what the ECE R110-approved CH variant is rated for."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 14 .

